extends /specs/products/aha/page-structure/structure/templates/structure/layout-tmpl.jade


block content
    section.source_section
        h2 Default headings

        markdown
            p From h1 to h6
        .source_example
            h1 H1 - Condensed Bold, 28px, line height normal
            h2 H2 - Condensed Bold, 24px, line height normal
            h3 H3 - Condensed Bold, 20px, line height normal
            h4 H4 - Condensed Bold, 18px, line height normal
            h5 H5 - Condensed Bold, 14px, line height normal
            h6 H6 - Condensed Bold, 12px, line height normal
    section.source_section
        h2 Default font size
        markdown
            p In the example below we have the normal text
        .source_example
            p Lorem ipsum
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `primary-text-size` class & `header-section-text` for header .
        .source_example
            p.primary-text-size Resources text
            p.header-section-text Call for papers title
            p.capitalize Lorem ipsum

    section.source_section
        h2 Heading styles

        h3 Section header
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `section__header` class.
        .source_example
            h2.section__header Latest Articles
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `primary-heading-size` class.
        .source_example
            h2.primary-heading-size Latest Articles

        h3 Page header
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `page__header` class.
        .source_example
            h2.page__header Latest Articles

        h3 With top Border
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `border-top` class.
        .source_example
            h3.border-top Latest Articles

        h3 With bottom Border
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `border-bottom` class.
        .source_example
            h3.border-bottom Latest Articles

    section.source_section
        h2 Blockquote

        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `quote` class.
        .source_example
            blockquote.quote
                | Concussions have become a critical public health issue, resulting in a substantial increase in research. As a clinician searching for the most up-to-date information, Concussion can serve as the go-to journal.



    | #{''}